🇺🇸🇺🇦🇷🇺 Don't Buy US-Ukraine "Tensions" (Again) 

▪️Ukraine would not exist as it does today without the US overthrowing, then politically capturing Ukraine's government, military and intelligence agencies which the US continues to control to this day;

▪️Ukraine's continued ability to strike targets in Russia is WHOLLY the result of constant daily intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance provided by the United States along with money, weapons, equipment, ammunition, and drones provided to Ukraine by the US itself;

▪️Every strike by Ukraine is thus a strike by the US. Just like with Israel, the US often plays games of public disapproval of actions it doesn't want political ownership of, but actions that couldn't take place without complete and constant US support;

▪️The fact that US-Ukrainian tensions or US-Israeli or US-EU tensions are so emotionally appealing to so many people makes this sort of theater that much more effective no matter how irrational and impossible it is in material reality;

▪️The notion of the US demanding "new leadership" for Ukraine in Kiev when Ukraine is run by Washington is elementary perception management - if Zelensky was never really in charge of anything, what difference does it make replacing him - except in terms of political narratives, plausible deniability, blame-passing etc.?

▪️As long as people keep falling for it though, the US will continue getting away with it, and buying time and space for its wars and proxy wars while doing so;
